 0A64FE0A)","Verified node1's 'chronyc clients' shows NTP requests served to node2, confirming bidirectional internal sync","Captured pre-restart baseline (boot_id, uptime, chrony active status, tracking/sources) on both nodes","Restarted node1 via native 'reboot' (backgrounded so ack returned before disconnect), polled until reachable, confirmed changed boot_id and uptime reset, confirmed chrony auto-started and returned to local stratum 10","Confirmed node2 remained synced to node1 across node1's restart","Restarted node2 via native 'reboot', polled until reachable, confirmed changed boot_id and uptime reset, confirmed chrony auto-started and node2 automatically re-synced to node1 (stratum 11) post-reboot","Final cross-check: node1 'chronyc clients' shows continued NTP requests from node2 after both restarts"],"evidence":[{"requirement":"node1 configured as internal time source (self-referenced local stratum, serving cluster subnet)","command_ids":["cmd-45f06c867d874359","cmd-b829fe282c504b95","cmd-c82629071a424dd9","cmd-e0a5711826dc4c73"],"summary":"chrony.conf on node1 stripped of public pools, 'allow 10.100.254.0/24' and 'local stratum 10' added; chronyc tracking shows Stratum 10 self-reference; ss shows chronyd listening on 0.0.0.0:123"},{"requirement":"node2 configured to sync against node1 instead of public NTP","command_ids":["cmd-0934078048274b0a","cmd-2500f01e574f469e","cmd-39e08685c42b4cef","cmd-8dedb8b4d5084320"],"summary":"chrony.conf on node2 stripped of public pools, 'server 10.100.254.10 iburst prefer' added; chronyc sources -v shows '^*' active sync to 10.100.254.10 at stratum 11 within seconds of chrony start"},{"requirement":"bidirectional confirmation node2 actually queries node1","command_ids":["cmd-d5b388e1316543ac"],"summary":"chronyc clients on node1 shows 4 NTP requests received from node2's IP"},{"requirement":"node1 healthy baseline before restart (boot identity + service/data health)","command_ids":["cmd-282fdb6c385f4e5c"],"summary":"nod